<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏrymbus</span></b> , i,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυμβος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a cluster of fruit, a
				cluster of flowers</i> of different plants; so esp. freq. of
				<i>a cluster of ivyberries</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 3,
				39</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 3, 665</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 6,
			52</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">for the crowning of Bacchus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 30</span></i>
			 (3, 28), 39; 3 (4), 17, 29; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of Osiris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 7, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferulae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 9, 56, § 175</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">elaphobosci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 22, 37, § 79 al.</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of carved clusters for the
			ornamenting of ships, <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 1, 273</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4,
			691</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The nipple</i>, <i><span class="en">Ser. Samm.
				20, 356</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>An elevation of earth</i>, <i><span class="en">Auct.
					Aetn. 106</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
